OL,3,GNEWSABus driver celebrates 30 years in
OL,4,A'stop-gap' job
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver is celebrating three
OL,7,Fdecades behind the wheel after
OL,8,Finitially thinking he would only do the
OL,9,Fjob for a couple of years.
OL,11,FAndrew Stewart, who has worked on the
OL,12,Fbuses since 1996, mostly travelling
OL,13,Fback and forth across Cumbria, has also
OL,14,Fscooped titles in the Bus Driver of the
OL,15,FYear competitions in his spare time.
OL,17,FThe 62-year-old from Cockermouth said
OL,18,Fhe initially intended the role to be a
OL,19,F"stop-gap", but had no plans to leave
OL,20,Fthe world of pneumatic doors any time
OL,21,Fsoon.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
