OL,3,GNEWSABus driver celebrates 30 years in
OL,4,A'stop-gap' job
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of his favourite memories was being
OL,7,Fselected to work at the London 2012
OL,8,FOlympics where he was in charge of
OL,9,Ftransporting the Angolan women's team
OL,10,Fto and from their training facilities.
